# Acceptance fixtures are generated, never committed: scripts/make-fixtures*.ps1
# (M2/M3) and scripts/make-m8-fixtures.ps1 (M8) rebuild them idempotently. The
# WAVs were already covered by the root *.wav rule; the mp4/vtt/json fixtures
# of the M8 import matrix are the same artefacts in other containers.
src-tauri/tests/fixtures/*
# Buchimport (lva#476): kleine synthetische PDFs und Skripte, eingecheckt.
!src-tauri/tests/fixtures/buchimport/
# Nemotron-Diarisierung (N1): kleine Referenzdaten aus
# koordination/nvidia-speech/tools/make_reference.py, eingecheckt (< 300 KB).
!src-tauri/tests/fixtures/nemotron/
